cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, encoding scheme, or code, please cite the article below."
title: "IVF/ICSI live-birth prediction: curated dataset and HAN + LR ensemble"
abstract: >-
  Code, curated dataset documentation, and figures for a study developing a
  Hybrid Attention Network plus logistic-regression ensemble to predict live
  birth after fresh embryo transfer in IVF/ICSI, together with a differential
  inner-cell-mass / trophectoderm weighting for encoding blastocyst morphology.
